@base = http://localhost:8101

### place an order (counter, summary, timer)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"product": "book", "paymentMethod": "upi", "amount": 300}

### rejected order (counts shop.orders.failed)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"product": "car", "paymentMethod": "cash", "amount": 200000}

### invalid payment method (400, no metric)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"product": "pen", "paymentMethod": "bitcoin", "amount": 10}

### take stock (gauge goes down)
POST {{base}}/inventory/book/take?units=3

### restock (gauge up, function counter +1)
POST {{base}}/inventory/book/restock?units=10

### long running report (LongTaskTimer active for 30 s)
POST {{base}}/reports?seconds=30

### @Observed method
GET {{base}}/recommendations/laptop

### high-cardinality tag (capped at 20 series)
POST {{base}}/visits/user-1

### all shop meters, Prometheus format
GET {{base}}/actuator/prometheus

### one metric with a tag filter
GET {{base}}/actuator/metrics/shop.orders.placed?tag=payment.method:upi
